--8<-- [start:description]
The virtual-package list includes effective values from trusted [channel-registered detectors](../../../workspace/multi_platform_configuration.md#virtual-package-detectors) and explicit overrides.
Detector entries show whether each detector ran, was cached, failed, or was skipped; failures include captured standard-error diagnostics.
Invalid virtual-package overrides fail the command instead of displaying fallback detection.

More information [here](../../../advanced/explain_info_command.md).
--8<-- [end:description]
